{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22509","headline":"送春归 · 白居易","name":"送春归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"送春归，三月尽日日暮时。\n去年杏园花飞御沟绿，何处送春曲江曲。\n今年杜鹃花落子规啼，送春何处西江西。\n帝城送春犹怏怏，天涯送春能不加惆怅。\n莫惆怅，送春人。\n冗员无替五年罢，应须准拟再送浔阳春。\n五年炎凉凡十变，又知此身健不健。\n好去今年江上春，明年未死还相见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}